        "Skill Perception +18, Stealth +20 (+24 in desert); Racial Modifiers +4 Stealth in desert"
      ],
      "SPECIAL ABILITIES": [
        "Seeds (Ex)",
        "A sandragora shoots out 4 seeds towards one target within a 30-foot range. If they hit, the target takes 1d6+2 piercing damage per seed. This ability does not provoke attacks of opportunity and is considered a thrown weapon for purposes of a strength bonus.",
        "Seed Burst (Su)",
        "Once per 1d2 rounds, a sandragora can shoot multiple seeds at a single target within 30-ft. If it hits (+16 ranged attack per seed), the target takes 14d6 piercing damage(1d6 per seed) and must make a Will save (DC 20) or be inflicted with the Confuse status for 1d4 rounds.",
        "Seed Cannon (Su)",
        "A sandragora can shoot a massive burst of seeds towards a single target within 60 feet. If it hits (+16 ranged attack per seed), the target takes 2d6 piercing damage. Blue mages may learn this ability as a 1st level spell (DC 17)."
      ]
    },
